6. Required fields: `description`, `justification`, `config`
7. Optional but recommended: `budget_weight` (defaults to 1.0)
8. Config must include: `strategy`, `tool`, and strategy-specific fields
9. Temperature: 0.0-2.0 | max_tokens: 1-100000
10. Models: gpt-4o, gpt-4o-mini, claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022, claude-sonnet-4-20250514, etc.

